    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 726274,
    "RowId": 39500,
    "Text": "Defeat the rampaging beasts!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 726314,
    "RowId": 39501,
    "Text": "Speak with Keshkwa"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 726346,
    "RowId": 39502,
    "Text": "Use Death Rattle"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 726374,
    "RowId": 39503,
    "Text": "Use Flanksting Strike"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 726406,
    "RowId": 39504,
    "Text": "Use Flanksbane Fang"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 726438,
    "RowId": 39505,
    "Text": "Use Hindsting Strike"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 726470,
    "RowId": 39506,
    "Text": "Use Hindsbane Fang"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 726502,
    "RowId": 39507,
    "Text": "Use Hunter's Coil"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 726530,
    "RowId": 39508,
    "Text": "Use Swiftskin's Coil"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 726562,
    "RowId": 39509,
    "Text": "Use Twinfang Bite"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 726590,
    "RowId": 39510,
    "Text": "Use Twinblood Bite"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 726622,
    "RowId": 39511,
    "Text": "Defeat the wandering gowrow"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 726662,
    "RowId": 39512,
    "Text": "If there are any meaner beasties, they must be biding their time. All I see here is fodder."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 726766,
    "RowId": 39513,
    "Text": "Though for practicing your new skills, they'll do fine."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 726834,
    "RowId": 39514,
    "Text": "I'll stay outta your way, and give you a few pointers."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 726902,
    "RowId": 39515,
    "Text": "Lemme know when you're ready."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 726942,
    "RowId": 39516,
    "Text": "Not bad at all! These techniques are some of the most important tools in your kit."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 727038,
    "RowId": 39517,
    "Text": "C'mon over here, and I'll tell you about attacking from Dual Fang stance."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 727122,
    "RowId": 39518,
    "Text": "You can wrap up your combination with Flanksting Strike, Flanksbane Fang, Hindsting Strike, or Hindsbane Fang."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 727246,
    "RowId": 39519,
    "Text": "Open a sequence with Steel Fangs or Reaving Fangs and work your way up to one of the four finishers."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 727358,
    "RowId": 39520,
    "Text": "Good work, <split(<String>ObjectParameter(1)</String>, ,1)>. Looks like you got the hang of Dual Fang stance."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 727446,
    "RowId": 39521,
    "Text": "That roar just now... Almost like it was telling 'em to clear out."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 727526,
    "RowId": 39522,
    "Text": "I reckon there's a big ol' bastard waiting in the wings. And now it's sent us tougher opposition!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 727634,
    "RowId": 39523,
    "Text": "Lucky for you, I got just the thing for dealing with lummoxes like them. I'll tell you all about it when you're ready."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 727766,
    "RowId": 39524,
    "Text": "Viper stance allows you to use your dual blades as a single weapon and bring everything you've got to bear!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 727886,
    "RowId": 39525,
    "Text": "You can even swap back into Dual Fang stance for Twinfang Bite or Twinblood Bite."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 727978,
    "RowId": 39526,
    "Text": "Alright, you got the hang of viper, I'd say."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 728034,
    "RowId": 39527,
    "Text": "That roaring's getting closer. Boss beast must be pissed that its minions keep getting beat."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 728138,
    "RowId": 39528,
    "Text": "Heh, and there it is!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 728170,
    "RowId": 39529,
    "Text": "Time to take it down a peg or three. Just remember what you're dealing with here─it ain't no pushover like the rest."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 728302,
    "RowId": 39530,
    "Text": "Still, you got all the tools you need at your disposal."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 728370,
    "RowId": 39531,
    "Text": "Show it what a viper can do!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 728410,
    "RowId": 39532,
    "Text": "Unrelenting attacks are the key! Don't give your prey a chance to fight back!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 728498,
    "RowId": 39533,
    "Text": "Some attacks work better from certain positions, so mind your footwork!"
  },
  {
