  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 729374,
    "RowId": 39600,
    "Text": "Defeat Iq Soq Xmajun!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 729406,
    "RowId": 39601,
    "Text": "Iq Soq Xmajun! Give me a bloody spectacle!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 729462,
    "RowId": 39602,
    "Text": "I would hate for this to end <i>too</i> quickly. Why not toy with them a little?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 729558,
    "RowId": 39603,
    "Text": "Worthy foes indeed... Iq Soq Xmajun, the time for games is over!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 729634,
    "RowId": 39604,
    "Text": "What was that!? Some underhanded tactic, no doubt..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 729698,
    "RowId": 39605,
    "Text": "Is this the limit of your power!? Kill them! Now!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 729758,
    "RowId": 39606,
    "Text": "Move, you great brute, move!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 729798,
    "RowId": 39607,
    "Text": "Do as I say! Tear them asunder!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 729842,
    "RowId": 39608,
    "Text": "We can't afford any mistakes! Stay sharp, <split(<String>ObjectParameter(1)</String>, ,1)>!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 729914,
    "RowId": 39609,
    "Text": "Wait─what's that smell?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 729950,
    "RowId": 39610,
    "Text": "Something's wrong with Iq Soq Xmajun. Don't tell me..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 730018,
    "RowId": 39611,
    "Text": "That's it! Innocent Stork's made a huge mistake!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 730078,
    "RowId": 39612,
    "Text": "Looks like it's through messing around. Keep it together!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 730146,
    "RowId": 39613,
    "Text": "That packed a punch!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 730178,
    "RowId": 39614,
    "Text": "So it's gathered some kinda energy in its wings... Can't take too many hits like that!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 730278,
    "RowId": 39615,
    "Text": "Golias is right. When it spreads its wings, get ready for a huge attack!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 730362,
    "RowId": 39616,
    "Text": "C'mon! Together, now!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 730394,
    "RowId": 39617,
    "Text": "Go for the wings! Keep it pinned down!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 730446,
    "RowId": 39618,
    "Text": "You did it! Now for the other wing!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 730494,
    "RowId": 39619,
    "Text": "That did the trick!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 730526,
    "RowId": 39620,
    "Text": "Don't hold back! It won't escape me again!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 730582,
    "RowId": 39621,
    "Text": "It's acting strangely! Be careful!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 730630,
    "RowId": 39622,
    "Text": "Godsdammit... This ain't over, not by a long shot!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 730694,
    "RowId": 39623,
    "Text": "<split(<String>ObjectParameter(1)</String>, ,1)>! You alright?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 730738,
    "RowId": 39624,
    "Text": "The wings! They accumulate aether before the beast strikes!"
  },
