    "RowId": 39897,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 737510,
    "RowId": 39898,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 737522,
    "RowId": 39899,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 737534,
    "RowId": 39900,
    "Text": "Defeat Chalteaufite's gang"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 737574,
    "RowId": 39901,
    "Text": "With the blessing, even one of us should be more than enough!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 737646,
    "RowId": 39902,
    "Text": "Hahaha! You are powerless to stop me!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 737694,
    "RowId": 39903,
    "Text": "Once I've dealt with you, Ala Mhigo is as good as mine!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 737762,
    "RowId": 39904,
    "Text": "Remember, “Cracks form in even the mightiest of shields”!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 737834,
    "RowId": 39905,
    "Text": "There must be some truth to it! Don't let up your attack!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 737902,
    "RowId": 39906,
    "Text": "Th-The barrier is fading!?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 737942,
    "RowId": 39907,
    "Text": "Is this what you meant?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 737978,
    "RowId": 39908,
    "Text": "That's it, <split(<String>ObjectParameter(1)</String>, ,1)>! If you keep hitting the same spot, it's sure to break!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 738074,
    "RowId": 39909,
    "Text": "This can't be... Don't just stand there gawping, surround them!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 738150,
    "RowId": 39910,
    "Text": "You fool, Chalteaufite! This is the limit of the artifact's power!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 738230,
    "RowId": 39911,
    "Text": "Leave this to me! Keep attacking the barrier!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 738286,
    "RowId": 39912,
    "Text": "Meddling curs! Let's see what you make of this!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 738346,
    "RowId": 39913,
    "Text": "There's no use fleeing! We've got to strike from a distance!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 738418,
    "RowId": 39914,
    "Text": "How could they shatter the barrier? The artifact's power is absolute!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 738498,
    "RowId": 39915,
    "Text": "Behold the power at my command!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 738542,
    "RowId": 39916,
    "Text": "Hahaha! The shockwave will make short work of you!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 738606,
    "RowId": 39917,
    "Text": "What are you waiting for! Destroy them!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 738658,
    "RowId": 39918,
    "Text": "Aaagh! How can this be happening!? You lot, keep them occupied!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 738734,
    "RowId": 39919,
    "Text": "Useless! Do I have to do everything myself!?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 738790,
    "RowId": 39920,
    "Text": "Hnnngh... At this rate, we won't last much longer!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 738854,
    "RowId": 39921,
    "Text": "Don't give in, Kaqool Ja! You still need to travel back to Tuliyollal, don't you?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 738946,
    "RowId": 39922,
    "Text": "You can't lose to someone like Chalteaufite!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 739002,
    "RowId": 39923,
    "Text": "Ha! You will learn the fate of those who betray me!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 739066,
    "RowId": 39924,
    "Text": "<split(<String>ObjectParameter(1)</String>, ,1)>! Stop those missiles!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 739118,
    "RowId": 39925,
    "Text": "Now, <split(<String>ObjectParameter(1)</String>, ,1)>! Smash the barrier!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 739170,
    "RowId": 39926,
    "Text": "Chalteaufite... You stole the vessel to threaten others, even your own followers! It's time for you to pay!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 739290,
    "RowId": 39927,
    "Text": "Aaaaaagh! Get away! Get away from me!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 739338,
    "RowId": 39928,
    "Text": "Not so tough without the blessing, are you!? Now's our chance, <split(<String>ObjectParameter(1)</String>, ,1)>!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 739430,
    "RowId": 39929,
    "Text": "Keep going! You can do this!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 739470,
    "RowId": 39930,
    "Text": "Attack the barrier"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 739502,
    "RowId": 39931,
    "Text": "Destroy the weakened barrier"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 739542,
    "RowId": 39932,
    "Text": "Destroy the missiles"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 739574,
    "RowId": 39933,
    "Text": "Defeat Chalteaufite's followers"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 739618,
    "RowId": 39934,
    "Text": "Defeat Chalteaufite Cravenscreed"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 739662,
    "RowId": 39935,
    "Text": "I don't need help to deal with the likes of you!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 739722,
    "RowId": 39936,
    "Text": "I grant myself the full might of the blessing! Resist me at your peril!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 739806,
    "RowId": 39937,
    "Text": "Even that shield will crack eventually! Trust in the teachings and keep attacking!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 739902,
    "RowId": 39938,
    "Text": "Imbeciles! Show some backbone!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 739946,
    "RowId": 39939,
    "Text": "It's working! Place your trust in the proverb!"
  },
